  m_text: "Niftyverse's polycephalic penguin PENGWEEVIL from the ICE KINGDOM has
    been assaulting DEGENs with a chilly CRYPTO WINTER, keeping prices cheap so that
    everything\u2019s on sale; the perfect opportunity for him to sweep floors and
    stack bags!\r\n\r\nUse your quick wits to avoid icicles and snowballs (snowballs
    can be b\xF6nked) and collect pick-ups to aid you in this dodgeball-inspired
    arcade game. Get far enough and square up against PENGWEEVIL himself for a chance
    to be the DEGEN hero to restore sunshine to the land!\r\n\r\nCan YOU survive
    the Crypto Winter?"
